## 8. Engineering Considerations

The project includes provisions for:

- Consistent webhook payload contracts.
- Submission error recovery and retry handling.
- Client-side anti-spam measures.
- Responsive layouts.
- Search-engine metadata.
- Accessible navigation and form interactions.

The repository also contains a pre-launch checklist covering integration, legal review, accessibility and deployment verification.

## 9. Validation & Limitations

This is an independent educational and portfolio project built around a simulated company.

It is not presented as a commissioned implementation or evidence of measurable commercial results.

Final production webhook verification, independent legal review, and other deployment sign-off items remain separate from the implemented application features.

## 10. Future Improvements

Potential next development stages include:

- Full end-to-end production workflow verification.
- Secure enquiry management dashboards.
- Expanded automated lead routing and follow-up.
- Integration monitoring and operational analytics.
- Formal accessibility and security testing.

